      ],
      "size": 9.960000038146973,
      "font": "Arial-BoldMT",
      "flags": 16,
      "color": 0
    },
    {
      "page_index": 21,
      "text": "The spring contact on the top side of the battery holder sets/bends based on the battery thickness.",
      "bbox": [
        85.10399627685547,
        330.27618408203125,
        525.4688720703125,
        341.381591796875
      ],
      "origin": [
        85.10399627685547,
        339.28997802734375
      ],
      "size": 9.960000038146973,
      "font": "ArialMT",
      "flags": 0,
      "color": 0
    },
    {
      "page_index": 21,
      "text": "In case a thicker battery (like BR1225, 2.5mm thickness) is inserted first, the spring contact will set",
      "bbox": [
        85.10399627685547,
        347.79620361328125,
        522.0991821289062,
        358.901611328125
      ],
      "origin": [
        85.10399627685547,
        356.80999755859375
      ],
      "size": 9.960000038146973,
      "font": "ArialMT",
      "flags": 0,
      "color": 0
    },
    {
      "page_index": 21,
      "text": "and later if the battery is replaced by a thinner battery (like BR1220, 2.0mm thickness) the battery",
      "bbox": [
        85.10399627685547,
        359.3161926269531,
        518.130615234375,
        370.4216003417969
      ],
      "origin": [
        85.10399627685547,
        368.3299865722656
      ],
      "size": 9.960000038146973,
      "font": "ArialMT",
      "flags": 0,
      "color": 0
    },
    {
      "page_index": 21,
      "text": "holder will not hold the replacement battery firmly.",
      "bbox": [
        85.10399627685547,
        370.836181640625,
        313.4989013671875,
        381.94158935546875
      ],
      "origin": [
        85.10399627685547,
        379.8499755859375
      ],
      "size": 9.960000038146973,
      "font": "ArialMT",
      "flags": 0,
      "color": 0
    },
    {
      "page_index": 21,
      "text": "Customers are advised not to use thinner batteries after using a thicker battery in the battery holder",
